    <AbilityDef>
        <defName>MX_Mingyuan_AshesOfSelf</defName>
        <label>&lt;color=#FF5C3A&gt;Ashes of Self&lt;/color&gt;</label>
        <description>Adds 20% blood loss and grants 100 Self Burn. Creates a moving 2.4-cell-radius field for 10 seconds. Every 0.5 seconds it burns enemies and adds Life Burn, heals the caster's wounds and scars, and builds Self Burn. Cooldown: 30 seconds.</description>
        <iconPath>MiliraXianMingyuan/UI/Ability_AshesOfSelf</iconPath>
        <category>MX_MingyuanSkill</category>
